@startuml
title UML sequence - exact approved synthetic funding correction
actor "Original Finance maker" as maker
actor "Independent canonical checker" as checker
participant "Staff portal / BFF" as web
participant "Finance corrections" as finance
database "Finance schema" as fs
participant "Controls" as controls
participant "Core CorrectionCommands" as core
database "Core ledger" as ledger
participant "Existing GL export pipeline" as gl
maker -> web : Original funding journal UUID + exact reason
web -> finance : Current workforce / Origin / CSRF / stable actor-client-key
finance -> core : Read immutable SYNTHETIC_FUNDING source
core --> finance : Original source / native fingerprint / exact two legs
finance -> fs : Commit frozen source, reversing legs, reason,\nexecution UUID, digest, expiry and audit intent
finance --> web : Durable original request reference
loop Wrapping 50-request worker cursor
 finance -> controls : Register same FINANCE_CORRECTION proposal and digest
 controls --> finance : Original registration (recover lost acknowledgment)
end
checker -> web : Review frozen source, exact debit/credit, reason and digest
web -> finance : Approve exact digest
finance -> controls : Current APPROVE role/queue; distinct canonical person; expiry
controls --> finance : APPROVED
maker -> web : Explicitly execute this approved correction
web -> finance : Original request + exact digest
finance -> fs : Commit execution-request observation before Core boundary
finance -> core : Same execution UUID / details / approved purpose
core -> ledger : Lock original source, then accounts in ascending UUID order
core -> controls : Native recheck after all locks:\nexact digest/scope/people, live grants/queues/approval expiry
core -> ledger : Check original funding legs and existing correction,\nactive restrictions / funds after holds / current UTC date
core -> ledger : Atomic linked CORRECTION journal + original Core receipt + outbox
ledger --> core : Immutable native financial receipt
core -x finance : Response lost after native commit
web -> finance : Read saved original request
finance -> core : Inquiry by original execution and exact scope
core --> finance : Same original native journal and receipt
finance --> web : EXECUTED; immutable source and reversing journal
finance -> gl : Existing discovery exports new linked journal
note over finance,ledger
One correction per original journal, including competing approvals.
Pending registration/approval and missing transport responses do not
establish financial completion or release held funds.
end note
@enduml
